 the alchemist ‘Democritus' to the wisdom of Egypt and Persia.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Martelli, Matteo. <title level="m">The Four Books of Pseudo-Democritus</title>. Sources of Alchemy and Chemistry; AMBIX 60, Supplement 1. Leeds: Maney Publishing, 2013.
